WEBVTT

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:20.620
For all your boasting, this is the result?

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:28.090
Osiris was destroyed, and Morok still stands. A fine outcome.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:33.560
A traveler who only notices the branches loses his way in the forest.

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.860
What?!

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:39.600
As you can see,
I've accomplished my purpose.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:44.210
The destruction of Osiris is insignificant.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.970
Don't confuse the method with the goal.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:53.580
The spirit of Osiris that signifies bitterness...

00:00:53.580 --> 00:01:00.020
And the vanity of the Doppelgangers that I've assembled...

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:02.920
The grief of the Maya...

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:08.800
My way of misleading the humans has proven to be most effective.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:19.070
I am surely the entity that spreads darkness throughout the world.

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:24.010
When humankind is in chaos and dark with evils, I shall arise again.

00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:31.790
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:35.760
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:38.260
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:42.760
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:48.570
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:52.510
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:56.540 --> 00:02:00.620
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:07.920
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:13.460
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:20.600
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:26.070
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:28.510
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:02:28.510 --> 00:02:35.450
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:37.720
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:41.790
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:44.290
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:48.830
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:54.640
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:57.540
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:17.590
You're a man, aren't you?
Bear it awhile longer.

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:20.230
It's a special Assassins' medicine for healing wounds.

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:22.790
It can heal any wound.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.670
There. Finished.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:34.470
Honestly. Without me, you just can't do anything, Iruga.

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:38.450
Say, Iruga, isn't this the Assassins Guild?

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:42.210
We can rest here until your wound heals, can't we?

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:48.960
Unless you get a good rest, you won't heal properly.

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:55.300
Oh, that reminds me. Why don't we have our wedding, since we're here?

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.130
Wedding?!

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:59.230
How wonderful they are...

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:01.360
Weddings...

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:17.950
I can't stand it anymore.

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:21.520
Poring...

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:24.930
What's with the sighing, you two?

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:27.630
What's wrong?

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:32.100
Those three are quiet, and it's really depressing.

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:34.970
I'm getting depressed, too.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:37.270
Poring...

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:01.630
Where're you going?

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:07.300
Iruga?

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.700
If he didn't answer...

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:13.240
He probably went to the toilet. Yes.

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:14.940
Poring.

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:20.820
You two, happiness runs away with every sigh you let out.

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:23.250
Here. Eat this and cheer up.

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:34.560
Big Brother...

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:40.670
Big Brother who was so kind...

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:48.180
Yuufa! You're slow!

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:50.150
Wait for me, Big Brother!

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.170
Yuufa!

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:58.350
Yuufa... There, there. Don't cry.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:02.890
Yuufa!

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:05.030
Filthy birds!

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:06.960
Go away, you!

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:12.430
Here.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:29.380
Where'd she go?

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:36.950
Yuufa!

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.390
Big Brother...

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:45.670
I was so scared, Big Brother!

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.070
There, there...

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:51.640
Even if you're a Novice now, you mustn't kill needlessly.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:57.310
Yuufa, there's meaning to every life that exists on earth.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.570
Yes, Big Brother.

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:08.160
It's a present from me, Yuufa.

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:12.530
Wow! It's so cute!

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:14.160
Thank you, Big Brother!

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:24.310
--No!
--Yuufa...

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:25.570
Go away!

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:27.600
Leave me alone!

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:41.380
Why? Why won't you answer me, <i>Sensei</i>?

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:45.880
You're no more than a pawn!

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:53.430
Your words have never been wrong.

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:54.830
Until now...

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:09.750
Watch where you're walking, Takius.

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.350
Yes, <i>Sensei.</i>

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:14.060
Well, I suppose you can't help it.

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:17.510
You're still not accustomed to the blindfold.

00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:25.960
Takius-<i>kun</i>!

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:28.600
Are you all right?

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:32.060
Yes, I'm fine. It's nothing...

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:36.580
You seem to have sprained your ankle.

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:40.310
Wait here.

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:42.650
I'll bring some herbs.

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:43.640
Yes, sir.

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:54.290
<i>Sensei</i>?

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.600
Child dogs?

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:11.580
Fire Sphere!

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:21.220
Takius-<i>kun...</i>

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:23.690
<i>Sensei...</i>

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:25.760
It hurts...

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:27.660
You're burning with fever.

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:33.760
Do not fear. I shall save you.
Trust in me.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:44.050
Where am I?

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:47.080
<i>Sensei</i>... have I been saved?

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:52.320
Yes, that's right. I told you the truth, didn't I?

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:57.090
Trust in me and you'll never go astray.

00:09:57.090 --> 00:09:58.790
...Takius-<i>kun.</i>

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:05.100
Why are you so reckless with her?!

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:09.540
Why are you angry, Maria-<i>kun</i>?

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.870
Putting a blindfold on this child...

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:14.210
What're you thinking?!

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:17.110
This child isn't your plaything.

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:22.220
What're you saying, Maria-<i>kun</i>?

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:26.750
How can you call yourself a great wizard?

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:28.120
It is all for...

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:31.230
The ultimate truth!

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:34.930
It must be pursued! And illuminated!

00:10:34.930 --> 00:10:39.660
Unless we secure the ultimate truth, mankind will have no future!

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:44.540
Takius-<i>kun...</i>

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:49.530
If you trust in me, you will never go astray.

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:55.750
<i>Sensei...</i>

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:59.490
Please guide me!

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:05.760
I... have lost my way!

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:11.130
That path to truth that you and I were to walk together...

00:11:11.130 --> 00:11:14.630
Please, please, help me find it!

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:29.720
The path to truth is far away, Takius-<i>kun</i>!

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:59.010
Roan! I'm disappointed in you.

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:09.720
--Yuufa...
--Go away!

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:11.220
Leave me alone!

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:41.480
Big Brother Iruga...

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:26.630
Forgive me, Yuufa...

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:29.240
I was to blame.

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:30.470
...For everything.

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:40.750
Take that!

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:42.580
You're asking for it!

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:45.210
Iruga!

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.430
Keough, you're soaking wet!

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:58.870
Huh? So are you.

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:07.610
Go, go!

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:22.350
Are you okay?

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:26.150
I think... I'm okay...

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:46.610
You're getting soft, Iruga.

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:48.080
You're the one who's soft.

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:49.910
We'll see about that.

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:21.950
Then I became an Assassin.

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:24.150
And Keough became a Knight.

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:27.250
And the two of us set out on a journey.

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:30.350
A short while later, you and Roan joined us.

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:41.860
Together with my friend, I felt that
I had a true brother and sister now.

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:53.680
Yuufa!

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.020
Thank you!

00:16:10.560 --> 00:16:12.600
Big Brother, look.

00:16:12.600 --> 00:16:15.400
Now I'm an Acolyte, aren't I?

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:32.190
But the time came when everything would change.

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:36.020
It was because of my fate as an Assassin.

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:38.090
Glast Heim?!

00:16:38.090 --> 00:16:40.190
That's right.
It's a dangerous journey.

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:42.030
You two wait at Prontera.

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:43.530
No! We don't want to!

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:46.370
That's right!
We're going with you!

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:47.890
But...

00:16:56.180 --> 00:17:01.280
Okay. But if there's any trouble, you must return.

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:03.010
--All right!
--All right!

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:06.590
The Glast Heim Disturbance...

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:10.820
I received reconnaissance orders from the Assassin Guild.

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:13.930
Reconnaissance orders?

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:17.360
I should have gone alone.

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:19.390
It was because of me that Keough...

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:36.080
Stay close to me, Yuufa!

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:47.160
The gate! I see the gate!

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:49.130
We're almost there! Hang on, Yuufa!

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:51.230
Yes!

00:17:51.230 --> 00:17:52.960
Big Brother Keough! Look!

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:07.050
Keough-<i>san</i>!

00:18:07.050 --> 00:18:08.480
Y-You two, run!

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:09.420
B-But!

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:10.980
Big Brother Keough!

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:15.520
Iruga-<i>san</i>!

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:16.990
I'll help...

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:19.960
Iruga! Take them and run!!

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:20.790
But...

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:22.290
Hurry and go!!

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.700
Forgive me...

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:27.870
Big Brother!

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.400
What're you doing?!

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:31.370
Wait! Big Brother!

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:34.570
--Go! Yuufa, go!
--Please let me go!

00:19:23.590 --> 00:19:27.250
I just... can't do it...

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:33.160
I can't!

00:19:35.640 --> 00:19:38.170
Let's have a big party! Go all-out!

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:40.840
A big party? What kind?

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:43.180
Hmmm. Let's see...

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:45.980
How about moving to Lutie?

00:19:45.980 --> 00:19:48.980
Lutie, that town where it's always snowing?

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:52.220
That's a happy Christmas town every day.

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:55.560
Everyone forgets all his troubles and is happy.

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:59.460
It's just an informal party to cheer up our gloomy friends.

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:03.000
There's no time to move, and they wouldn't go, anyway.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:06.970
You're right. Hmm...

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:08.200
Oh!

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:12.170
How about this, then? Costume party!

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:14.110
Huh?

00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:15.340
A costume party?

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:16.910
Poring!

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:18.640
I'd go as...

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:22.120
Meow!

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:23.380
And I'd be...

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:25.090
Poring...

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:26.450
Angel Ma-<i>chan.</i>

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:28.560
Poring...

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:30.120
It might be nice...

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.560
It might be.

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:33.490
Poring...

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:39.370
I know! Wouldn't it be a good idea to hold a wedding for Iruga and me then?

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:41.230
It just might be!

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:48.880
Come, come.

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:49.940
What?

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:52.110
Just come with us.

00:20:52.110 --> 00:20:55.350
You come with me for a minute, Iruga.

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:57.480
You two, over here, over here.

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:04.460
What's going on?

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:06.050
Just wait.

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:23.640
Yaay! Isn't the bride pretty?

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:26.050
It's not a real wedding, though.

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:33.250
Takius-<i>san</i>? What's wrong?

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:39.230
How nice it is to have friends...

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:43.930
They went to so much trouble to cheer us up...

00:21:50.570 --> 00:21:52.370
Where's Roan?

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:55.380
We went to call him, but he wasn't in his room.

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:56.840
Right, Poi-poi?

00:21:56.840 --> 00:21:58.680
Poring.

00:21:58.680 --> 00:22:00.310
I wonder where he went?

00:22:10.790 --> 00:22:12.890
I loves ya, Iruga!

00:22:17.330 --> 00:22:18.730
What is it?

00:22:19.870 --> 00:22:21.870
Sir...

00:22:21.870 --> 00:22:23.170
What?!

00:22:28.240 --> 00:22:30.180
It's Al de Baran!

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round</i> <i>that will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.670 --> 00:23:34.540
<i>Hiya! This is W! It's terrible!</i>

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:37.810
<i>Roan falls in with</i> <i>some wicked adventurers.</i>

00:23:37.810 --> 00:23:41.750
<i>Is this a total image change?</i>
<i>What's going to happen?</i>

00:23:41.750 --> 00:23:43.480
<i>Next time,</i> "The Protector."

00:23:43.480 --> 00:23:45.150
<i>See you then!</i>
